MLOps makes AI deployments repeatable and predictable.

80
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:13,136
生命周期有五个核心阶段：数据准备、训练、验证、推理服务和监控。
The lifecycle has five core stages data preparation, training, validation, serving, and monitoring.

81
00:05:13,422 --> 00:05:17,924
NVIDIA 软件栈针对 GPU 加速优化了每个阶段。
The NVIDIA software stack optimizes each stage for GPU acceleration.

82
00:05:18,126 --> 00:05:19,696
监控并不是终点。
Monitoring is not the end.

83
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:24,096
监控产生的反馈会推动重训和持续改进。
Monitoring creates feedback that drives retraining and continuous improvement.

84
00:05:24,398 --> 00:05:26,496
