A strong exam ready summary is this.

85
00:05:26,862 --> 00:05:34,576
生产级 AI 是一个闭环系统，其中数据、训练、验证、推理服务和监控通过自动化协同工作。
Production AI is a closed loop system where data, training, validation, serving, and monitoring work together through automation.

86
00:05:34,894 --> 00:05:36,576
1. 章节介绍。
1. Section Introduction.

87
00:05:36,814 --> 00:05:40,336
现在让我们来看看第一阶段：数据收集与准备。
Now let us examine stage 1, data collection and preparation.

88
00:05:40,622 --> 00:05:45,856
每个 AI 系统都始于数据，但原始数据很少能直接用于模型训练。
Every AI system begins with data, but raw data is rarely ready for model training.

89
00:05:46,094 --> 00:05:55,776
它可能包含缺失值、重复记录、格式错误、类别不平衡、噪声图像、标签不一致或非结构化文本。
It may contain missing values, duplicate records, incorrect formats,
unbalanced classes, noisy images, inconsistent labels, or unstructured text.

90
00:05:56,046 --> 00:06:02,884
如果预处理很慢，昂贵的 GPU 可能会在等待 CPU 完成数据清洗时处于闲置状态。
If pre-processing is slow, expensive GPUs may sit idle while waiting for the CPU to finish data cleaning.

91
00:06:03,118 --> 00:06:04,896
这会造成流水线瓶颈。
This creates a pipeline bottleneck.

92
00:06:05,166 --> 00:06:08,016
2. 核心思想与认证重点。
2. Core ideas and certification focus.

93
00:06:08,302 --> 00:06:11,616
这一阶段的主要问题是 CPU 数据瓶颈。
The main problem in this stage is the CPU data bottleneck.

94
00:06:11,856 --> 00:06:17,776
传统的预处理通常在 CPU 上运行，使用数据框和机器学习库。
Traditional pre-processing often happens on the CPU using dataframe and machine learning libraries.

95
00:06:18,062 --> 00:06:22,896
对于小数据集来说这没问题，但在 AI 规模下就会变得低效。
That can be acceptable for small datasets, but it becomes inefficient at AI scale.

96
00:06:23,182 --> 00:06:27,296
RAPIDS 通过将数据科学工作负载转移到 GPU 上来解决这个问题。
Rapids addresses this by moving data science workloads onto the GPU.

97
00:06:27,536 --> 00:06:32,416
CUDF 提供类似于 Pandas 的 GPU 加速数据框 API。
CUDF provides a GPU accelerated data frame API similar to Pandas.

98
00:06:32,782 --> 00:06:38,176
CUML 提供类似于 ScikitLearn 的 GPU 加速机器学习算法。
CUML provides GPU accelerated machine learning algorithms similar to ScikitLearn.

99
00:06:38,446 --> 00:06:47,536
DOLI 加速深度学习的数据加载和预处理，特别是需要调整大小、解码、裁剪和增强的图像流水线。
DOLI accelerates data loading and pre-processing for deep learning, especially
image pipelines that need resizing, decoding, cropping, and augmentation.

100
00:06:47,790 --> 00:06:51,812
目标是让数据靠近 GPU 计算，并减少空闲时间。
The goal is to keep data close to GPU compute and reduce idle time.

101
00:06:52,046 --> 00:06:53,856
3. 解释图表。
3. Explain the diagram.

102
00:06:54,094 --> 00:06:58,244
图表显示原始数据从存储移动到 GPU 内存中。
The diagram shows raw data moving from storage into GPU memory.

103
00:06:58,416 --> 00:07:06,496
RAPIDS 不再将所有预处理工作发送到 CPU，而是直接在 GPU 内存中加载和转换数据集。
Instead of sending all pre-processing work through the CPU, Rapids loads and transforms the dataset directly in GPU memory.

104
00:07:06,798 --> 00:07:14,496
诸如删除空值、去重、过滤、特征创建和格式转换等清洗步骤是并行完成的。
Cleaning steps such as removing null values, deduplication, filtering, feature creation, and format conversion happen in parallel.

105
00:07:14,734 --> 00:07:22,852
准备好的数据集随后可以流向训练框架，而无需在
CPU 内存和 GPU 内存之间进行不必要的来回传输。
The prepared dataset can then flow into the training framework without
unnecessary transfers back and forth between CPU memory and GPU memory.

106
00:07:23,086 --> 00:07:26,896
这减少了 GPU 气泡，并提高了端到端的吞吐量。
This reduces the GPU bubble and improves end-to-end throughput.

107
00:07:27,182 --> 00:07:28,576
4. 解释代码。
4. Explain the code.

108
00:07:28,782 --> 00:07:33,924
代码导入了 CUDF，它是 RAPIDS 生态系统中的 GPU 数据框库。
The code imports codf, which is the GPU dataframe library in the Rapids ecosystem.

109
00:07:34,126 --> 00:07:38,468
它将名为 RAW sensor data 的 CSV 文件读取到 GPU 数据框中。
It reads a CSV file called RAW sensor data into a GPU dataframe.

110
00:07:38,702 --> 00:07:41,456
然后它删除缺失值和重复行。
Then it removes missing values and duplicate rows.

111
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:45,136
最后，它打印出清洗后的数据框的前几行。
Finally, it prints the first few rows of the clean data frame.

112
00:07:45,486 --> 00:07:47,856
重要的概念不是语法。
The important concept is not the syntax.

113
00:07:48,110 --> 00:07:56,868
重要的概念是加载、清洗和去重是利用 GPU 并行处理完成的，而不是仅仅依赖 CPU 处理。
The important concept is that loading, cleaning, and deduplication are
performed using GPU parallelism instead of relying only on CPU processing.

114
00:07:57,102 --> 00:08:00,176
5. NCA-AIIO 认证要记住什么？
5. NCAAI Joe certification What to remember?

115
00:08:00,590 --> 00:08:03,536
为了 NCA-AIIO 考试，请记住以下几点。
For the NCAA AI Joe exam, remember these points.

116
00:08:03,918 --> 00:08:08,496
数据准备可能会成为 AI 流水线中的第一个主要瓶颈。
Data preparation can become the first major bottleneck in AI pipelines.

117
00:08:08,782 --> 00:08:12,816
RAPIDS 在 GPU 上加速数据科学和预处理。
Rapids accelerates data science and pre-processing on GPUs.

118
00:08:13,102 --> 00:08:17,376
CUDF 与 GPU 加速数据框处理相关联。
CUDF is associated with GPU Accelerated DataFrame Processing.

119
00:08:17,616 --> 00:08:22,256
CUML 与 GPU 加速机器学习算法相关联。
CUML is associated with GPU Accelerated Machine Learning Algorithms.

120
00:08:22,574 --> 00:08:26,884
DOLI 与深度学习的快速数据加载和预处理相关联。
DALLI is associated with fast data loading and pre processing for deep learning.

121
00:08:27,086 --> 00:08:29,296
这是一个强有力的备考总结。
A strong exam ready summary is this.

122
00:08:29,550 --> 00:08:39,216
阶段 1 使用 GPU 加速的数据准备来快速清洗和转换原始
数据，这样训练 GPU 就能保持忙碌，而不是等待 CPU。
Stage 1 uses GPU accelerated data preparation to clean and transform raw
data quickly so that training GPUs stay busy instead of waiting for the CPU.

123
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:41,280
1. 章节介绍。
1. Section Introduction.

124
00:08:41,549 --> 00:08:45,840
接下来，让我们看看第二阶段：模型训练和分布式计算。
Next, let us look at stage 2, model training and distributed computing.

125
00:08:46,094 --> 00:08:53,360
数据准备好后，模型将使用 PyTorch、TensorFlow 或 JX 等训练框架从这些数据中学习。
After data is prepared, the model learns from that data using a training framework such as PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JX.

126
00:08:53,646 --> 00:09:02,400
对于现代 AI，特别是大语言模型和对话式 AI，训练可能需要许多 GPU 在多个服务器上协同工作。
For modern AI, especially large language models, and conversational AI,
training can require many GPUs working together across many servers.

127
00:09:02,734 --> 00:09:05,520
2. 核心概念和认证重点。
2. Core ideas and certification focus.

128
00:09:05,838 --> 00:09:11,520
训练是计算密集型的，因为模型在大型数据集上执行重复的矩阵运算。
Training is compute intensive because models perform repeated matrix operations over large datasets.

129
00:09:11,982 --> 00:09:19,920
对于对话式 AI 和大语言模型，NVIDIA NeMo 提供了一个用于训练、
微调和扩缩容模型的端到端框架。
For conversational AI and large language models, NVIDIA Nemo provides
an end-to-end framework for training, tuning, and scaling models.

130
00:09:20,206 --> 00:09:25,636
Megatron 支持大规模模型并行，用于超大规模的 Transformer 训练。
Megatron supports large-scale model parallelism and is used for very large transformer training.

131
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:31,040
当进行分布式训练时，GPU 必须交换梯度并同步更新。
When training is distributed, GPUs must exchange gradients and synchronize updates.

132
00:09:31,310 --> 00:09:33,760
这种通信必须极其快速。
This communication must be extremely fast.

133
00:09:34,158 --> 00:09:37,920
NCCL 代表 NVIDIA 集体通信库。
NCCL stands for NVIDIA Collective Communications Library.

134
00:09:38,158 --> 00:09:44,388
它提供了优化的通信操作，例如全归约、广播、归约和聚合。
It provides optimized communication operations such as all reduce, broadcast, reduce, and gather.

135
00:09:44,654 --> 00:09:51,680
为了通过认证，请记住 NCCL 帮助多 GPU 和多节点训练避免通信瓶颈。
For certification, remember that NCCL helps multi-GPU and multi-node training avoid communication bottlenecks.

136
00:09:52,046 --> 00:09:53,828
3. 解释图表。
3. Explain the diagram.

137
00:09:54,062 --> 00:09:58,640
图表显示了多个训练节点，每个节点包含多个 GPU。
The diagram shows multiple training nodes, each containing several GPUs.

138
00:09:58,926 --> 00:10:01,280
每个 GPU 进程都是工作负载的一部分。
Each GPU process is part of the workload.

139
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:04,800
在训练过程中，GPU 在本地计算梯度。
During training, the GPUs compute gradients locally.

140
00:10:05,038 --> 00:10:08,720
然后必须合并这些梯度，以更新共享的全局模型。
Then those gradients must be combined to update a shared global model.

141
00:10:09,070 --> 00:10:15,588
NCCL 通过 NVLink 和高速网络等快速互连高效地处理这种同步。
NCCL handles this synchronization efficiently over fast interconnects such as NVLink and high-speed networking.

142
00:10:15,854 --> 00:10:20,320
核心思想是，分布式训练不仅仅是增加更多的 GPU。
The big idea is that distributed training is not only about adding more GPUs.

143
00:10:20,558 --> 00:10:26,720
它还涉及协调这些 GPU，确保通信不会抵消并行计算带来的收益。
It is also about coordinating those GPUs so communication does not cancel the benefit of parallel compute.

144
00:10:26,990 --> 00:10:28,320
4. 解释代码。
4. Explain the code.

145
00:10:28,622 --> 00:10:32,080
这段代码是用于启动分布式训练任务的 Slurm 脚本。
The code is a Slurm script for launching a distributed training job.

146
00:10:32,302 --> 00:10:42,400
它创建了一个训练任务名称，申请四个节点，申请八个 GPU，设置运行时，
然后使用 NCCL 后端启动 Python 训练程序。
It creates a training job name, requests four nodes, requests eight GPUs, sets a runtime,
and then launches a Python training program using the NCCL backend.

147
00:10:42,798 --> 00:10:45,920
重要的操作概念是资源调度。
The important operational concept is resource scheduling.

148
00:10:46,222 --> 00:10:53,280
Slurm 分配集群资源，而 NCCL 管理训练期间 GPU 之间的有效通信。
Slurm allocates the cluster resources, while NCCL manages efficient communication between GPUs during training.

149
00:10:53,518 --> 00:10:57,440
它们共同协作，让训练工作负载能够扩展到单台机器之外。
Together, they allow a training workload to scale beyond a single machine.

150
00:10:57,710 --> 00:11:00,880
5. NCA-AIIO 认证要点。
5. NCAA certification What to remember.

151
00:11:01,198 --> 00:11:04,160
为了通过 NCA-AIIO 考试，请记住以下几点。
For the NCAA AI Joe exam, remember these points.

152
00:11:04,526 --> 00:11:08,800
PyTorch、TensorFlow 和 JX 是常见的模型训练框架。
PyTorch, TensorFlow, and JX are common model training frameworks.

153
00:11:09,134 --> 00:11:13,440
Nemo 对对话式 AI 和大语言模型工作流非常重要。
Nemo is important for conversational AI and large language model workflows.

154
00:11:13,710 --> 00:11:17,280
Megatron 与大规模 Transformer 训练相关联。
Megatron is associated with large-scale transformer training.

155
00:11:17,550 --> 00:11:21,440
NCCL 用于优化的多 GPU 通信。
NCCL is used for optimized multi-GPU communication.

156
00:11:21,742 --> 00:11:26,400
全归约是分布式训练中同步梯度的关键操作。
All reduce is a key operation for synchronizing gradients in distributed training.

157
00:11:26,670 --> 00:11:28,800
这是一个非常适合备考的总结。
A strong exam ready summary is this.

158
00:11:29,134 --> 00:11:38,160
第二阶段使用 GPU 加速框架训练模型，并使用 NCCL 在多个 GPU 和节点之间高效同步工作。
Stage 2 trains models using GPU accelerated frameworks and uses NCCL to synchronize work efficiently across many GPUs and nodes.

159
00:11:38,478 --> 00:11:40,080
1. 章节介绍。
1. Section Introduction.

160
00:11:40,398 --> 00:11:44,388
现在我们进入第三阶段：模型验证和实验追踪。
Now we move to stage 3, model validation and experiment tracking.

161
00:11:44,590 --> 00:11:47,440
训练好的模型并不会自动进入生产环境。
A trained model is not automatically ready for production.

162
00:11:47,726 --> 00:11:55,120
必须仔细评估，以确认其表现良好、行为安全，并符合业务和运营要求。
It must be evaluated carefully to confirm that it performs well, behaves safely, and meets business and operational requirements.

163
00:11:55,406 --> 00:11:58,960
验证是训练与部署之间的质量门。
Validation is the quality gate between training and deployment.

164
00:11:59,278 --> 00:12:02,080
2. 核心思想和认证重点。
2. Core ideas and certification focus.

165
00:12:02,414 --> 00:12:09,680
验证的目标是测试模型的准确性、损失、安全边界、偏差、鲁棒性和泛化能力。
The goal of validation is to test model accuracy, loss, safety boundaries, bias, robustness, and generalization.

166
00:12:09,966 --> 00:12:13,360
模型可能在训练数据上表现良好，但在新数据上失败。
A model may perform well on training data, but fail on new data.

167
00:12:13,614 --> 00:12:16,000
这就是为什么验证数据集至关重要。
That is why validation datasets are essential.

168
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:19,556
实验追踪记录每次运行的完整历史。
Experiment tracking records the full history of each run.

169
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:27,360
这包括超参数、数据集版本、代码版本、模型产物、指标和评估结果。
This includes hyperparameters, dataset versions, code versions, model artifacts, metrics, and evaluation results.

170
00:12:27,694 --> 00:12:31,680
常用的实验追踪工具包括 MLflow 和 Weights & Biases。
Common experiment tracking tools include ML flow and weights and biases.

171
00:12:31,982 --> 00:12:35,920
验证门会自动决定模型是否可以继续前进。
Verification gates automatically decide whether a model can move forward.

172
00:12:36,206 --> 00:12:40,320
如果准确性太低或安全检查失败，流水线就应该停止。
If accuracy is too low or safety checks fail, the pipeline should stop.

173
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,480
3. 解释图表。
3. Explain the diagram.

174
00:12:42,734 --> 00:12:46,320
图表显示训练好的模型进入验证阶段。
The diagram shows a trained model entering the validation stage.

175
00:12:46,606 --> 00:12:49,440
模型将针对验证数据集进行评估。
The model is evaluated against a validation dataset.

176
00:12:49,742 --> 00:12:52,480
指标被记录在实验追踪系统中。
Metrics are recorded in an experiment tracking system.

177
00:12:52,782 --> 00:12:58,148
如果模型达到要求的阈值，它将被提升到模型注册表或部署路径。
If the model meets the required thresholds, it is promoted to the model registry or deployment path.

178
00:12:58,414 --> 00:13:03,268
如果失败，系统会将其退回进行微调、重训或数据改进。
If it fails, the system sends it back for tuning, retraining, or data improvement.

179
00:13:03,534 --> 00:13:08,960
这可以保护生产环境免受弱、不安全、有偏差或未经验证的模型的影响。
This protects production environments from weak, unsafe, biased, or unverified models.

180
00:13:09,262 --> 00:13:10,640
4. 解释代码。
4. Explain the code.

181
00:13:10,894 --> 00:13:13,760
代码使用 MLflow 来追踪模型实验。
The code uses MLflow to track a model experiment.

182
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:22,372
它启动一个 MLflow 运行，记录学习率参数，记录验证准确性，并将模型权重文件作为产物存储。
It starts an MLflow run, logs a learning rate parameter, records validation accuracy, and stores the model weight file as an artifact.

183
00:13:22,606 --> 00:13:27,440
这意味着实验以后可以被搜索、对比、复现和审计。
This means the experiment can be searched, compared, reproduced, and audited later.

184
00:13:27,758 --> 00:13:29,840
核心概念就是可追溯性。
The important idea is traceability.

185
00:13:30,126 --> 00:13:36,560
在企业级 AI 中，团队必须准确知道是哪些数据、参数和模型文件产生了特定的结果。
In Enterprise AI, teams must know exactly which data, parameters, and model files produced a given result.

186
00:13:36,846 --> 00:13:39,920
5. NCA-AIIO 认证要点。
5. NCAA certification What to remember.

187
00:13:40,334 --> 00:13:43,360
针对 NCA-AIIO 考试，记住以下几点。
For the NCAA AI Joe exam, remember these points.

188
00:13:43,662 --> 00:13:46,720
验证环节是检查模型是否准备好投入生产。
Validation checks whether a model is ready for production.

189
00:13:46,958 --> 00:13:52,160
实验追踪负责记录参数、指标、数据集和模型产物。
Experiment tracking records parameters, metrics, datasets, and model artifacts.

190
00:13:52,558 --> 00:13:56,480
MLflow 以及权重和偏置是常用的实验追踪工具。
ML flow and weights and biases are common tools for tracking experiments.

191
00:13:56,782 --> 00:14:00,400
自动化关卡有助于防止失败的模型进入生产环境。
Automated gates help prevent failed models from reaching production.

192
00:14:00,654 --> 00:14:02,800
这是一个强有力的备考总结。
A strong exam ready summary is this.

193
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:11,140
第三阶段验证模型质量并记录实验证据，因此只有经过批准且可复现的模型才能进入部署阶段。
Stage 3 validates model quality and records experiment evidence, so only approved and reproducible models move into deployment.

194
00:14:11,502 --> 00:14:13,188
1. 章节介绍。
1. Section Introduction.

195
00:14:13,422 --> 00:14:17,440
接下来，让我们讨论第四阶段：部署与模型优化。
Next, let us discuss stage 4, deployment and model optimization.

196
00:14:17,774 --> 00:14:22,148
在模型投入生产推理之前，应该针对目标硬件进行优化。
Before a model is served in production, it should be optimized for the target hardware.

197
00:14:22,382 --> 00:14:27,840
原始训练模型可能运行太慢、体积太大，或者在大规模运行时成本太高。
A raw training model may be too slow, too large, or too expensive to run at scale.

198
00:14:28,078 --> 00:14:30,960
这就是 NVIDIA TensorRT 发挥重要作用的地方。
This is where NVIDIA TensorRT becomes important.

199
00:14:31,246 --> 00:14:34,000
2. 核心思想与认证重点。
2. Core ideas and certification focus.

200
00:14:34,382 --> 00:14:38,880
TensorRT 是针对已训练神经网络的推理优化器和运行时。
TensorRT is an inference optimizer and runtime for trained neural networks.

201
00:14:39,118 --> 00:14:44,388
它将模型转换为可以在 NVIDIA GPU 上高效运行的优化引擎。
It converts a model into an optimized engine that can run efficiently on NVIDIA GPUs.

202
00:14:44,622 --> 00:14:50,800
优化可以包括层融合、算子选择、内存优化和精度转换。
Optimization can include layer fusion, kernel selection, memory optimization, and precision conversion.

203
00:14:51,118 --> 00:15:03,920
量化根据硬件和模型需求，将模型精度从 FP32 等格
式降低到 FP16、INT8、FP8 或 FP4 等更小的格式。
Quantization reduces model precision from formats such as FP32 into smaller formats such as FP16, INT8, FP8, or FP4,
depending on hardware and model requirements.

204
00:15:04,238 --> 00:15:10,880
较低的精度可以减少内存占用并提高吞吐量，但必须经过验证以确保精度在可接受范围内。
Lower precision can reduce memory usage and improve throughput, but it must be validated to ensure acceptable accuracy.

205
00:15:11,278 --> 00:15:20,240
TensorRT LLM 为大语言模型推理扩展了优化概念，采用了诸如连续批处理和键值缓存优化等技术。
TensorRT LLM extends optimization concepts for large language model inference
with techniques such as continuous batching and key value cache optimization.

206
00:15:20,526 --> 00:15:22,320
3. 解释图表。
3. Explain the diagram.

207
00:15:22,542 --> 00:15:26,400
图表显示了一个模型进入优化流水线。
The diagram shows a ROM model entering an optimization pipeline.

208
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:30,240
模型被导出为 ONNX 等交换格式。
The model is exported into an exchange format such as ONNX.

209
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:39,652
TensorRT 分析网络，融合兼容层，选择高效算子，应用精度优化，并生成序列化引擎。
TensorRT analyzes the network, fuses compatible layers, chooses efficient
kernels, applies precision optimization, and produces a serialized engine.

210
00:15:39,886 --> 00:15:44,720
该引擎随后即可用于高性能推理服务，通常是通过 Triton 推理服务器实现的。
That engine is then ready for high-performance serving, usually through Triton inference server.

211
00:15:44,942 --> 00:15:50,880
目标是在不破坏模型质量的前提下，降低延迟、提高吞吐量并减少内存占用。
The goal is to reduce latency, improve throughput, and lower memory usage without breaking model quality.

212
00:15:51,118 --> 00:15:52,480
4. 解释代码。
4. Explain the code.

213
00:15:52,750 --> 00:15:58,788
该命令使用 TensorRT 将 ResNet 50 ONNX 模型编译成 TensorRT 引擎文件。
The command uses TrueTechSec to compile a ResNet 50 ONNX model into a TensorRT engine file.

214
00:15:59,022 --> 00:16:03,760
FP16 选项告诉 TensorRT 在可能的情况下使用半精度。
The FP16 option tells TensorRT to use half precision where possible.

215
00:16:04,014 --> 00:16:10,480
保存的引擎针对 NVIDIA GPU 推理进行了优化，运行速度比原始的未优化模型更快。
The saved engine is optimized for NVIDIA GPU inference and can run faster than the original unoptimized model.

216
00:16:10,734 --> 00:16:17,600
对于运维团队来说，这个命令代表了从训练好的模型到生产就绪的推理产物之间的转换步骤。
For operations teams, this command represents the conversion step between a trained model and a production ready inference artifact.

217
00:16:17,952 --> 00:16:20,992
5. NCA-AIIO 认证要记住什么？
5. NCAAI Joe certification What to remember?

218
00:16:21,422 --> 00:16:24,432
为了 NCA-AIIO 考试，请记住以下几点。
For the NCAA AI Joe exam, remember these points.

219
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:28,272
不要把部署仅仅看作是把模型复制到服务器上。
Do not think of deployment as simply copying a model to a server.

220
00:16:28,622 --> 00:16:33,072
TensorRT 为在 NVIDIA GPU 上进行推理优化训练好的模型。
TensorRT optimizes trained models for inference on NVIDIA GPUs.

221
00:16:33,358 --> 00:16:39,312
常见的优化思路包括层融合、内核自动调优、内存规划和量化。
Common optimization ideas include layer fusion, kernel auto-tuning, memory planning, and quantization.

222
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:44,512
TensorRT LLM 与优化的超大规模语言模型推理相关。
TensorRT LLM is associated with optimized large language model inference.

223
00:16:44,782 --> 00:16:46,912
这是一个强有力的备考总结。
A strong exam ready summary is this.

224
00:16:47,246 --> 00:16:54,352
第 4 阶段通过将经过验证的模型编译并优化为快速、高效的推理引擎，为生产环境做好准备。
Stage 4 prepares a validated model for production by compiling and optimizing it into a fast, efficient inference engine.

225
00:16:54,606 --> 00:16:56,272
1. 章节介绍。
1. Section Introduction.

226
00:16:56,526 --> 00:17:01,312
现在让我们继续第 4 阶段，重点关注低延迟的生产推理服务。
Now let us continue stage 4 by focusing on low-latency production inference serving.

227
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:06,352
模型优化完成后，用户和应用程序需要一种可靠的方法来调用它。
Once a model has been optimized, users and applications need a reliable way to call it.

228
00:17:06,606 --> 00:17:15,070
这需要一个能够接收请求、高效进行批处理、运行
推理并在服务水平预期内返回结果的推理服务层。
This requires a serving layer that can receive requests, batch them efficiently, run inference,
and return results within service level expectations.

229
00:17:15,470 --> 00:17:19,472
NVIDIA Triton 推理服务器就是为这种生产服务角色设计的。
Nvidia Triton Inference Server is designed for this production serving role.

230
00:17:19,726 --> 00:17:22,512
2. 核心思想和认证重点。
2. Core Ideas and Certification Focus.

231
00:17:22,862 --> 00:17:27,952
Triton 是一个支持多种模型框架和后端的生产推理服务器。
Triton is a production inference server that supports multiple model frameworks and backends.

232
00:17:28,238 --> 00:17:35,792
它可以提供来自 TensorRT、ONNX 运行时、PyTorch、TensorFlow、
Python 以及其他支持后端的模型。
It can serve models from TensorRT, ONNX runtime, PyTorch, TensorFlow, Python, and other supported backends.

233
00:17:36,078 --> 00:17:39,072
它最重要的功能之一是动态批处理。
One of its most important features is dynamic batching.

234
00:17:39,278 --> 00:17:45,952
动态批处理将独立的传入请求合并到一个批次中，以便 GPU 能够更高效地处理它们。
Dynamic batching combines separate incoming requests into a single batch so the GPU can process them more efficiently.

235
00:17:46,318 --> 00:17:50,832
Triton 可以在遵守延迟限制的同时提高 GPU 利用率。
Triton can improve GPU utilization while still respecting latency limits.

236
00:17:51,150 --> 00:17:59,872
NVIDIA NIM 提供预构建的推理微服务，打包了模型、运行时、API 和容器，以便于生产部署。
Nvidia NM provides pre-built inference microservices that package models, runtimes, APIs,
and containers for easier production deployment.

237
00:18:00,110 --> 00:18:01,872
3. 解释图表。
3. Explain the diagram.

238
00:18:02,126 --> 00:18:05,952
图表显示了多个客户端请求独立到达。
The diagram shows multiple client requests arriving independently.

239
00:18:06,222 --> 00:18:13,232
Triton 不会把每个请求逐一发送到 GPU，而是先将兼容的请求放入队列并形成一个批次。
Instead of sending each request to the GPU one by one, Triton briefly queues compatible requests and forms a batch.

240
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:16,032
该批次在 GPU 上一起处理。
That batch is processed together on the GPU.

241
00:18:16,238 --> 00:18:19,552
然后结果被分离并返回给原始客户端。
The results are then separated and returned to the original clients.

242
00:18:19,886 --> 00:18:25,392
这提高了吞吐量，因为 GPU 在处理更大的并行工作负载时表现最强。
This increases throughput because GPUs are strongest when they process larger parallel workloads.

243
00:18:25,678 --> 00:18:28,512
这张图还强化了推理服务路径。
