NM 将优化的 AI 推理能力封装为可部署的微服务。
NM packages optimized AI inference capabilities as deployable microservices.

258
00:19:28,750 --> 00:19:30,832
这是一个强有力的备考总结。
A strong exam ready summary is this.

259
00:19:31,182 --> 00:19:41,392
Triton 通过管理请求、批处理工作、高效利用 GPU 并提供低延迟响应，
将优化后的模型转化为可扩展的生产端点。
Triton turns optimized models into scalable production endpoints by managing requests,
batching work, using GPUs efficiently, and serving responses with low latency.

