Production systems must be watched continuously because both data behavior and infrastructure behavior can change.

264
00:19:58,414 --> 00:20:02,432
监控可以帮助团队及早发现问题并完成反馈循环。
Monitoring helps teams detect problems early and close the feedback loop.

265
00:20:02,670 --> 00:20:05,472
2. 核心思想和认证重点。
2. Core ideas and certification focus.

266
00:20:05,774 --> 00:20:08,192
生产监控有两个主要方面。
Production monitoring has two major sides.

267
00:20:08,494 --> 00:20:10,724
第一方面是基础设施监控。
The first side is infrastructure monitoring.

268
00:20:10,990 --> 00:20:18,032
这包括 GPU 利用率、内存占用、温度、功耗、错误计数和健康状态。
This includes GPU utilization, memory usage, temperature, power draw, error counts, and health status.

269
00:20:18,286 --> 00:20:20,592
第二方面是模型可观测性。
The second side is model observability.

270
00:20:20,846 --> 00:20:27,152
这包括数据漂移、预测漂移、准确率下降、延迟变化和异常输出。
This includes data drift, prediction drift, accuracy degradation, latency changes, and unusual outputs.

271
00:20:27,502 --> 00:20:34,032
NVIDIA DCGM，即数据中心 GPU 管理器，负责收集用于数据中心操作的 GPU 遥测数据。
Nvidia DCGM, or data center GPU manager, collects GPU telemetry for data center operations.

272
00:20:34,318 --> 00:20:42,340
GPU 算子负责在 Kubernetes 中自动化部署 NVIDIA 驱动、容器工具包、设备插件和监控组件。
GPU operator automates deployment of NVIDIA drivers, container toolkit, device plugin, and monitoring components in Kubernetes.

273
00:20:42,574 --> 00:20:48,804
当监控检测到问题时，自动化可以触发告警、回滚、扩缩容或重训。
When monitoring detects problems, automation can trigger alerts, rollback, scaling, or retraining.

274
